":1680}]}]},{"comment":"The introduction of the `limit` field and its handling in various constructors and methods seems consistent. However, it\u0027s important to ensure that all code paths correctly initialize and handle this new field, especially in deserialization (`MvExpand(StreamInput)`). The comment in `#YFJJN` indicates that the limit is only needed on the coordinator, which should be documented or handled appropriately if there are scenarios where this might not hold true.","nodes":[{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/planner/Mapper.java-x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/planner/Mapper.java-10474:10572-10638:10759,10772:11075,11095:11101","promptId":"#RWZPP","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/planner/Mapper.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/planner/Mapper.java","srcChanges":[{"pos":10474,"endPos":10572,"startLine":231,"startLineOffset":19,"endLine":231,"endLineOffset":117,"length":99}],"dstChanges":[{"pos":10638,"endPos":10759,"startLine":234,"startLineOffset":12,"endLine":234,"endLineOffset":133,"length":122},{"pos":10772,"endPos":11075,"startLine":235,"startLineOffset":12,"endLine":239,"endLineOffset":13,"length":304},{"pos":11095,"endPos":11101,"startLine":240,"startLineOffset":19,"endLine":240,"endLineOffset":25,"length":7}]},{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/logical/MvExpand.java-x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/logical/MvExpand.java--3815:3820","promptId":"#BVTDX","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/logical/MvExpand.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/logical/MvExpand.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":3815,"endPos":3820,"startLine":122,"startLineOffset":79,"endLine":122,"endLineOffset":84,"length":6}]},{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/ja