in/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/analysis/Analyzer.java-x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/analysis/Analyzer.java--24880:24889","promptId":"#XN4DE","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/analysis/Analyzer.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/analysis/Analyzer.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":24880,"endPos":24889,"startLine":511,"startLineOffset":20,"endLine":511,"endLineOffset":29,"length":10}]}]},{"comment":"The `writeTo` method includes an assertion that `limit \u003d\u003d null`, which will fail if a limit is set. This assertion should be removed or adjusted to handle cases where a limit is present.","nodes":[{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/logical/MvExpand.java-x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/logical/MvExpand.java--1999:2003,2004:2043","promptId":"#YFJJN","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/logical/MvExpand.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/logical/MvExpand.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":1999,"endPos":2003,"startLine":51,"startLineOffset":12,"endLine":51,"endLineOffset":16,"length":5},{"pos":2004,"endPos":2043,"startLine":51,"startLineOffset":17,"endLine":51,"endLineOffset":56,"length":40}]},{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/logical/MvExpand.java-x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/logical/MvExpand.java--2312:2333","promptId":"#ZQ1R4","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/logical/MvExpand.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/logical/MvExpand.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":2312,"endPos":2333,"startLine":61,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":61,"endLineOffset":29,"length":22}]}]}],"groundTruthGeneratedCommentsNodes":[{"groundTruth":{"original_line":61,"line":61,"comment_lines":["[][61]"],"review_comment":["I guess this never triggers b/c there\u0027s currently always going to be a limit below MV_EXPAND, so it\u0027ll never be serialized in the fragment, right? ","It never happens because we do the serialization after the physical planning, and the mapper will resolve an `MvExpand(limit\u003dn)` into a `LimitExec(n) + MvExpandExec`; after physical planning, even if that fragment remains the same, it will be re-translated to `Limit(n) + MvExpand` and serialized.\r\n","To clarify, we don\u0027t need to serialize it _now_, but we could. It would be yet another transport version bump, and since it\u0027s a fix and it will be backported, I preferred to make the backport as smooth as possible","I think I get it.\r\n\r\n\u003e To clarify, we don\u0027t need to serialize it now, but we could.\r\n\r\nThe fragment will contain the logical plan, the \"original\" one. So theoretically, we might need to serialise an `MvExpand` with a non-null limit. In which case the assertion would trip. But `MvExpand`\u0027s limit would be non-`null` only if a limit was pushed down over it and since limit is a pipeline breaker, the plan will be latest broken down at the limit, so MvExpand will, in current form, never make it onto the nodes. Right?\r\nThe translation to physical and the mapping wouldn\u0027t then influence this, I guess.","\u003e and since limit is a pipeline breaker, the plan will be latest broken down at the limit, so MvExpand will, in current form, never make it onto the nodes. Right?\r\n\r\nCorrect, and it\u0027s enough to guarantee that limited MV_EXPAND will never make it into the data nodes.\r\n\r\n\u003e The translation to physical and the mapping wouldn\u0027t then influence this, I guess.\r\n\r\nI think you\u0027re right\r\n"],"path":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/logical/MvExpand.java","id":37267,"created_at":"2024-10-28T12:43:58Z","original_position":34,"side":"RIGHT","position":34,"submitted_on_commit":"5755968002086a78a66840628de4680f868407da","diff_hunk":"@@ -51,6 +58,7 @@ public void writeTo(StreamOutput out) throws IOException {\n         out.writeNamedWriteable(child());\n         out.writeNamedWriteable(target());\n         out.writeNamedWriteable(expanded());\n+        assert limit \u003d\u003d null;","submitted_line":61},"generatedCommentsNodes":[{"comment":"The `writeTo` method includes an assertion that `limit \u003d\u003d null`, which will fail if a limit is set. This assertion should be removed or adjusted to handle cases where a limit is present.","nodes":[{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/logical/MvExpand.java-x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/logical/MvExpand.java--1999:2003,2004:2043","promptId":"#YFJJN","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/logical/MvExpand.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/logical/MvExpand.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":1999,"endPos":2003,"startLine":51,"startLineOffset":12,"endLine":51,"endLineOffset":16,"length":5},{"pos":2004,"endPos":2043,"startLine":51,"startLineOffset":17,"endLine":51,"endLineOffset":56,"length":40}]},{"id":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/logical/MvExpand.java-x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/logical/MvExpand.java--2312:2333","promptId":"#ZQ1R4","srcPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/logical/MvExpand.java","dstPath":"x-pack/plugin/esql/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/xpack/esql/plan/logical/MvExpand.java","srcChanges":[],"dstChanges":[{"pos":2312,"endPos":2333,"startLine":61,"startLineOffset":8,"endLine":61,"endLineOffset":29,"length":22}]}]}]}],"coveredGroundTruth":1,"uncoveredGroundTruth":0,"coveredMatchable":14,"uncoveredMatchable":10,"timing"